Autonomous Agentic AI
Simple Definition

Autonomous Agentic AI is an advanced AI system that independently plans, executes, monitors, learns, adapts, and completes complex goals with minimal human intervention.

Workflow
--------

Goal
   │
   ▼
Perceive
   │
   ▼
Reason
   │
   ▼
Plan
   │
   ▼
Execute
   │
   ▼
Observe
   │
   ▼
Learn
   │
   ▼
Adapt
   │
   ▼
Complete Goal


